/a>:</b> This item gives a +10 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to your saves versus spells.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Resistance\" title=\"Spell Resistance\"> Spell Resistance +38</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b> Spell Resistance +38:</b> +38 Enhancement bonus to <a href=\"/page/Spell_Resistance\" title=\"Spell Resistance\">Spell Resistance</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Crystal\" title=\"Crystal\">Crystal</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Crystal\" title=\"Crystal\">Crystal</a>:</b> <a href=\"/page/Crystal\" title=\"Crystal\">Crystal</a> weapons are able to overcome the protective <a href=\"/page/Damage_reduction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage reduction\">damage reduction</a> of many <a href=\"/page/Quori\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quori\">Quori</a> creatures, which can be resistant to other weapons. <br /> Spell failure chances for armors and shields made from crystal are also decreased by 10%.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[h